      "content": "**语法点 G003 代词体系**\r\n· 人称代词主格(I/you/he...)与宾格(me/you/him...)；作主语用主格，作宾语/介词宾语用宾格\r\n· 物主代词：形容词性(my/your/his/her/its/our/their)+名词；名词性(mine/yours/his/hers/ours/theirs)单独使用\r\n· 反身代词：myself/yourself...；固定搭配 by oneself, enjoy oneself, help oneself to, teach oneself\r\n· 指示代词：this/these 近指，that/those 远指；that/those 可代替前面名词避免重复\r\n· 不定代词：some/any, both/either/neither, all/none, each/every, many/much, few/a few(可数), little/a little(不可数)\r\n· 复合不定代词：something/anything/nothing 等，形容词后置：something interesting；指人用 somebody/anybody/nobody\r\n例: That pen is mine. Please give it to me.\r\n例: There is nothing wrong with the machine.\r\n",
