      "content": "**语法点 G017 情态动词表推测**\r\n· 肯定推测：must(一定) > may/might(可能) > could(可能)；语气递减\r\n· 否定推测：can't/couldn't(不可能)，不用 mustn't 表推测\r\n· 对现在推测：must/may/can't + do；对正在发生：+ be doing；对过去：+ have done\r\n· must have done(过去一定…)，can't have done(过去不可能…)，may/might have done(过去可能…)\r\n· should have done 本应该做而没做；shouldn't have done 本不该做而做了；needn't have done 本不必做却做了\r\n· could have done 本可以做(未做) 或表对过去的可能\r\n例: He must be in the library now.\r\n例: She can't have finished so much work in one day.\r\n",
