      "content": "**语法点 G037 短语动词与动词搭配**\r\n· 动词+副词：turn on/off/up/down, put on/off/away/up, take off/away/up, give up/in/away, look up/after/for/at, come up/across, work out, carry out, find out, pick up, wake up, cheer up, set off, break down/out/in, bring up, call off/back\r\n· 动词+介词：look after/for/at/into, listen to, wait for, depend on, rely on, belong to, agree with/to/on, deal with, refer to, apply for/to, care about/for, search for, ask for, laugh at, worry about, think of/about/over\r\n· 动词+副词+介词：catch up with, keep up with, come up with, look forward to, put up with, get along/on with, run out of, make up for\r\n· 固定 be+介词/形容词短语：be good at, be bad for, be interested in, be proud of, be fond of, be tired of/from, be angry with/about, be busy with, be familiar with\r\n· 高频 to 介词短语(后接动名词)：look forward to, devote to, stick to, pay attention to, get down to, lead to, object to\r\n· 三单/过去式/分词变化与不规则动词需系统记忆\r\n例: Please look up the new word in the dictionary.\r\n例: We must pay attention to protecting the environment.\r\n",
