      "content": "**语法点 G039 构词法：派生/合成/转化**\r\n· 派生(前缀)：否定 un-/im-/in-/ir-/il-/dis-/non-/mis-；其他 re-/pre-/post-/over-/under-/inter-/sub-/super-/en-/tele- 等(见词根索引-前缀表)\r\n· 派生(后缀)：名词 -tion/-sion/-ment/-ness/-er/-or/-ist/-ian/-ity/-ance/-ence/-ship/-hood/-dom/-ure/-age；形容词 -ful/-less/-ous/-al/-ive/-able/-ible/-ic/-y/-ish/-ern；副词 -ly/-ward(s)/-wise；动词 -ize/-ise/-en/-ify；详见 spec 后缀表\r\n· 词性变化常见组：act/action/active/activity; decide/decision; describe/description; explain/explanation; pronounce/pronunciation; succeed/success/successful; suggest/suggestion; introduce/introduction 等(见派生词族文件)\r\n· 合成：bedroom, football, underground, handwriting, warm-hearted, good-looking, however 等\r\n· 转化：名词变动词 water(n.水-v.浇水), hand, book, cook；动词变名词 help, walk, swim；形容词变名词 wrong, right\r\n· 同根异义注意：economic 经济的/economical 节约的；historic 有历史意义的/historical 历史的\r\n例: —What is your pronunciation of this word? (pronounce)\r\n例: Failure is the mother of success. (fail→failure)\r\n",
